Ladybird’s activeTab grant lasts until its tab navigates to another
origin or closes, as in Chromium, whose ActiveTabPermissionGranter::
DidFinishNavigation() keeps a grant across same-origin navigations.
Gecko ties the grant to the document instead (activeTabWindowID, in
ext-tabs-base.js, must equal the tab’s innerWindowID), so there any new
document ends it. A click on an action without a popup dispatches
onClicked with the tab, in all three engines.
